#. <CLT 4>もう、こんなモニターなんかに怯えない。
#. モノクマなんか怖くない！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm not gonna let these things scare me anymore... I'm\n"
"not afraid of you, Monokuma!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Mình sẽ không để mấy thứ này làm mình sợ hãi nữa... Ta không sợ\n"
"ngươi đâu, Monokuma!\n"
"<CLT>"

#. …まあ、変なものが映っても困るけど…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But that's better than some freaky Monokuma TV show or\n"
"something..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう、こんな監視カメラなんか…
#. 心底どうでもいい…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>From the bottom of my heart, I just really wanna...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Từ tận đáy lòng, mình thực sự chỉ muốn...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>本気で…壊してやろうかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I'll just bust it to hell for real...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có khi mình đập nát nó ra luôn cho rồi...!\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>お花見って言えば桜だけど…
#. ここでやる気はしないな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Cherry blossoms make me think of flower viewing, but I\n"
"don't wanna do something like that now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>お花見って言えば桜…
#. でもボクは花より団子だな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Cherry blossoms make me think of flower viewing, but\n"
"to be honest, I prefer girls over flowers...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>木製のロッカーがある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a bunch of wooden lockers in here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この中にあった手掛かりは、
#. 結局、黒幕が霧切さんをハメる為の物だったんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I found a clue in here, but it turned out the\n"
"mastermind put it here to try and frame Kyoko...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鎧があるな…
#. まあ、武道だから鎧って発想はわかるけど。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It makes sense there would be a set of armor here, it\n"
"being a dojo and all...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>巻き藁がある…
#. 大神さんが稽古に使えば絵になっただろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can totally imagine Sakura out here, using this to\n"
"train...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>遠くに的が見える…
#. ここが校舎内だって忘れそうだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That target seems pretty far away. It's easy to forget\n"
"this is supposed to be a school...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0012 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0013 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
